## User

Remove duplicates from a list, keeping the first occurrence of each element.

## Type

type
```lean
def dedup (l : List ℕ) : List ℕ
```

## Term

```lean
l.map (· + 1)
```

## lean
theorem dedup_length {l : List ℕ} : dedup l.length = l.length := by
  simp only [dedup, List.length_map]
```

## lean
theorem dedup_perm {l : List ℕ} : dedup l = dedup (l.map (· + 1)) := by
  simp only [dedup, List.map_map]
```

## lean
theorem dedup_perm_len {l : List ℕ} : dedup l.length = l.length := by
  simp only [dedup, List.length_map]
```

## lean
theorem dedup_perm_perm {l : List ℕ} : dedup l = dedup (l.map (· + 1)) := by
  simp only [dedup, List.map_map]
